WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.270
When a task is finished, tick the box beside it.

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:09.010
It is crossed out, and the open count goes down by one.

00:00:09.460 --> 00:00:14.670
The filters help you focus. Open shows only what is left to do.

00:00:15.120 --> 00:00:20.570
Done shows what you have finished. And All brings everything back.
